  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Budapest Metropolitan University is the biggest private University and art institution in Hungary. Established in 2000, the University offers accredited and internationally recognised degrees in various fields.</p><p>It has four campuses, which houses its 9 institutes. The University has partnered with more than 180 local and international educational institutions to provide student exchange programs.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At Budapest Metropolitan University, you can be part of a community of over 6,500 students from around 100 countries. The University has a vast array of clubs for music, movies, photography, travelling, creative expression, arts, and theatre.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Budapest Metropolitan University has a well-equipped partner hostel, the CEU Residence Centre, which is home to many international students. It can be reached by public transport in 12 minutes. The accommodation prices range from EUR 380-440.</p><p>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The University’s central library on the main campus contains books and academic literature, along with optional literature such as fiction and non-fiction.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>At the University, you can join various sports including football, basketball, volleyball, pole fitness, squash, wall-climbing, running, and cycling. The sports team at the University also hosts different activities and sports events, including hiking.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
